      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Our simplified approach.<br>\n </span><span class=\"futura-bold\">Your goals in mind.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Join Stryker at Premier Breakthroughs to explore solutions available through our Premier and SURPASS contracts. Connect with Stryker experts, discover technologies across our portfolio and engage in conversations centered on your organization's priorities.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 23 2026 20:38:06 GMT+0000",
