          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Attend the Stryker Experience</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Tuesday, Oct 6 | 6:30-9:00 p.m.</b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Join Stryker for an exclusive customer experience during Premier Breakthroughs.</span></b> Connect with healthcare leaders, supply chain professionals and Stryker experts in a relaxed setting while exploring Stryker's contracted SURPASS portfolio. Food and beverage provided.</span></p>\n",
